        <description>Represents the competitor total bid for the product without any discount in US dollars.</description>
        <formula>Pricing_Comp_Single_System_Price_Amt__c  *  Pricing_Competitor_Systems_Cnt__c</formula>
        <formulaTreatBlanksAs>BlankAsZero</formulaTreatBlanksAs>
        <inlineHelpText>Competitor Single System Price x Competitor No. of Systems (in US Dollars).</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Competitor Total without discount</label>
