        <description>Represents the total discount as a percent of the bid price.</description>
        <formula>(Pricing_Total_Bid_without_Discount_Amt__c  -  Pricing_Net_IA_Bid_Price_Amt__c)  /  Pricing_Total_Bid_without_Discount_Amt__c</formula>
